### RUN .setup for platform-ports-2026-10-21T1323 (tb470, u0 + u1 only) -- cut from
### bench-setup/tb470.setup.current (GENERATED 2026-10-20T192716Z; probe 2026-10-21T002632Z MATCH).
### Gate 5 (STANDING-ORDERS §6): it declares only the units this run uses. The bench has only
### these two units, so nothing is dropped. The [power]/[powerlink] lines are tb470.static's
### record (undisputed) and stay so the probe reads MATCH against this file; the session fact
### (Test Engineer 2026-10-21 13:2x) "No PDU / do not power-cycle" means NO case and NO tool
### uses them. No framework run binds this file; the six cases are manual CLI. It is NOT
### deployed; the box's template is unchanged.

[power]
pwr_e = (pdu, 10.36.150.14, 3)
pwr_f = (pdu, 10.36.150.14, 4)

[switch]
swi_e = /dev/u0
swi_f = /dev/u1

[baudrates]
